<title>USA: Mylan to buy back up to 5 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Mylan to buy back up to 5 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mylan Laboratories Inc said Monday its board had authorized a stock repurchase program of up to five million shares.</p>
<p>The purchases will be made on the open market or in privately negotiated transactions, the company said.</p>
<p>Repurchased shares will be held in Treasury.</p>
</text>
